### Radix V2 REST collection
### Open in VSCode with the "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) extension.
### Switch env via Ctrl+Alt+E ("local" vs "vps").
### Vars come from .vscode/settings.json rest-client.environmentVariables.

### 1. HEALTH
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health


### 2. LOGIN — grab @authToken for the rest of the collection
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
@authToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}


### 3. CLIENTS — list all
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 4. CALENDAR MONTHS — active only (archived hidden by default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/cmobqsqfa0008kzt94e2mi04m/calendar/months
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 5. CALENDAR MONTH — read one
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/cmobqsqfa0008kzt94e2mi04m/calendar/May%202026
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 6. ARCHIVE month (soft, reversible)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/cmobqsqfa0008kzt94e2mi04m/calendar/May%202026
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 7. ARCHIVED list — for the Previous Months drawer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/cmobqsqfa0008kzt94e2mi04m/calendar/archived
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 8. RESTORE an archived month
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/cmobqsqfa0008kzt94e2mi04m/calendar/May%202026/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 9. HARD DELETE (permanent, requires ?hard=true)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/cmobqsqfa0008kzt94e2mi04m/calendar/May%202026?hard=true
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 10. CONTENT PIECES — list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/cmobqsqfa0008kzt94e2mi04m/content-pieces
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 11. CONTENT PIECE — create
# @name createPiece
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/cmobqsqfa0008kzt94e2mi04m/content-pieces
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "REST-Client smoke: Ramadan hero reel",
  "type": "Reel",
  "station": "Lebanon",
  "status": "Draft",
  "assignee": "weni",
  "deadline": "2026-05-15",
  "notes": "imported from requests.http"
}

###
@pieceId = {{createPiece.response.body.id}}


### 12. CONTENT PIECE — patch status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/content-pieces/{{pieceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "In Review"
}


### 13. CONTENT PIECE — delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/content-pieces/{{pieceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 14. ASSISTANT chat — Radix Assistant (Claude Sonnet 4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assistant/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "give me a one-sentence status check of this content plan"
}


### 15. CREATIVE improve prompt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/creative/prompt/improve
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "luxury watch lifestyle shot"
}


### 16. CREATIVE image generate (gemini imagen-4.0-fast)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/creative/images/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "minimalist dark UI dashboard mockup",
  "aspectRatio": "16:9"
}


### 17. PROVIDERS status — verify fallback chain
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/providers/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 18. JOB status — check BullMQ-backed job
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 19. AGENT mode endpoints — SHOULD 404 (deleted 2026-04-23)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
